{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id9171855"}, "name":{"label":"MamosaNanosa"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2021-07-06T05:35:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.2.1"}, "id":{"label":"7545422057"}, "title":{"label":"Not as accurate as other apps"}, "content":{"label":"My partner introduced me to the app a few months ago, singing it’s praises particularly on accuracy with rain predictions. As I’m out and about with work I invested in the app so I could prepare for the days weather (London is definitely a 4seasons in one day kinda place). I unfortunately have not found Carrot to be so accurate. The forecast is too broad, One Prediction for the whole of London is as useful as a chocolate tea pot, the weather changes borough to borough let alone north to south. I wonder if this issue occurs in other cities/county’s around the UK? I’ve found the bbc weather app to be far more accurate.... and it’s free!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id38104333"}, "name":{"label":"KeefDu"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2021-07-04T13:33:23-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.2.1"}, "id":{"label":"7539485196"}, "title":{"label":"Glados from portal does the weather. Love the humour, it’s also accessible with VoiceOver"}, "content":{"label":"I got it to replace DarkSky, then found it was using DarkSky as the source. D’oh! It’s fun to use and seems to be accessible for those with sight issues using VoiceOver. Yay. Carrot ftw Too expensive for premium though. Drop the price a bit and I’ll pay.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id995703376"}, "name":{"label":"Scrumfulpo9876"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2021-07-04T12:58:42-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.2.1"}, "id":{"label":"7539409725"}, "title":{"label":"An absolutely fantastic weather!"}, "content":{"label":"God this app is amazing! While people enjoy simple weather apps this one is on a whole different level. Don’t get me started in the dozens of customisations and options you can choose from, even if it is behind a premium subscription it’s still worth it. The creator deserves it for adding the hilarious humour into CARROT, the aesthetics, design and yours truly the AI CARROT. It’s very important that there is a balance with information and the humour, it’s a weather app after all and CARROT has that perfect balance. I only have one complain though and it’s the wind speeds that may sometimes very inaccurate so I don’t really recommend you to rely on it. At the end of the day, the creator has done a great job and if you want something to replace your default weather app on your phone, choose CARROT.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"21"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"31"}}, 
